          "standfirst": "AtleticoTimHortons began the gameweek 6th and met an its_ohi side who started it top.",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Everton's Jarrad Branthwaite was the best player on the pitch in the Toffees' 1-0 win at Newcastle, with Vitalii Mykolenko alongside him at the back for AtleticoTimHortons. Riccardo Calafiori and Ezri Konsa both took clean sheets from Arsenal's win at Liverpool, so that match settled nothing between these sides.",
